T1  - Effect of Electroacupuncture Preconditioning on Myocardial Ischemia and Expression of TLR 4, MyD 88 and NF-κB mRNAs in "Neiguan" (PC 6) Area in Rats with Myocardial Ischemia-reperfusion Injury
