N2  - To study the intervention after experimental intracerebral hemorrhage(ICH) in rats treated by the electroacupuncture( EA) at different time points. 192 rats were divided into normal control group, sham operated group, ICH model group and EA group. Every group was divided into 6h,24h,72h and 7d subgroups. Produce the ICH modeles,evaluate the behavioral changes and observe the change of each rat brain tissue appearance after the intervention. Evaluate the behavioral changes before killing all the rats,there's no statistical significance between the subgroups(P<0.05);It was discovered that the model set's brain tissue surrounding the hematoma was necrosis,contain lots of hemosiderin particles,phlegmasia cells infiltrated with the method of observation under light microscope. Compare with the model set,the EA set 's damage was abatement,especially of the beginning of 6h treatment. The EA treatment at different time points,especially of the 6h subgroups,can lessen the dropsy of the brain tissue,lighten the inflammatory reaction,protect the nerve cells and promote the function recovery of the brain tissue.
